        <h1>What Your Mortgage Payment <em>Really Includes</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain guide to the true monthly cost of a home: what a principal-and-interest quote leaves out, how PMI and escrow really work, and why so many free mortgage calculators are lead-capture forms in disguise. The Best Answer Hub Mortgage Calculator shows the full payment and sends nothing to a server.</p>
